Precedent lineage: dw_2958 computes per-academic-year AVG/VARIANCE/STDDEV of NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS via `SUBJECT_OFFERED JOIN ACADEMIC_TERMS ON TERM_CODE`; dw_1212/dw_3644/dw_1335 compute TOTAL_UNITS stats on SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY with `TOTAL_UNITS > 0 AND NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS >= 1`; dw_4527 filters SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY with `TERM_CODE LIKE '2021%'` (LIKE-on-TERM_CODE precedent).\n\n### 3. Similar-Entity Differences\n\n**3a. Dimension matrix (evidence-cited):**\n\n| Dimension | SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY | COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED | SUBJECT_SUMMARY | SUBJECT_OFFERED |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Granularity | subject per term (table desc) | subject offering per term/year (concept matrix) | subject/cluster per term | section per term |\n| TOTAL_UNITS | yes (columns) | yes (columns) | yes | **no** (concept matrix \"Unit measures: None\") |\n| NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS | yes (columns) | **no** (concept matrix \"Enrollment: None\") | no (has SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_NUMBER) | yes, section grain |\n| Fall-term filter | TERM_CODE LIKE '%FA' (term_code concept: FA=Fall) | IS_OFFERED_FALL_TERM flag | TERM_CODE LIKE '%FA' | TERM_CODE LIKE '%FA' |\n| Dept filter | OFFER_DEPT_NAME | DEPARTMENT_NAME | DEPARTMENT_NAME | OFFER_DEPT_NAME |\n| Academic year/desc | via ACADEMIC_TERMS join (graph edge) | own ACADEMIC_YEAR; desc via join | via join | via join (dw_2958) |\n| Fan-out risk | none (subject grain) | catalog duplicates per subject possible | cluster rows may double-count | section rows multiply subjects |\n\n**3b. Task-Requirement Fitness:**\n- Required measures: TOTAL_UNITS + NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS per academic year, Mathematics, fall term.\n  - SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY: SUPPORTED (both columns exist; subject grain; precedent dw_1212 uses exactly `TOTAL_UNITS > 0 AND NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS >= 1` on this table).\n  - COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED: NOT-SUPPORTED for enrollment (no NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS — concept matrix).\n  - SUBJECT_SUMMARY: NOT-SUPPORTED for \"number of enrolled